accff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":7,"created_at":"2026-07-13T11:52:53Z","updated_at":"2026-09-08T23:53:39Z","closed_at":"2026-09-08T17:14:12Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121322","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121322","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121322.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121322.patch","merged_at":"2026-09-08T17:14:12Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nThe following code would previously not compile even though the getter is untyped:\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nvar _prop: int\r\nvar prop: String: get = get_f\r\n\r\nfunc get_f():\r\n    return _prop\r\n```\r\n\r\nIt now passes the analyzer. (Note: I think we have an issue with untyped getters were we are missing runtime checks somewhere, but that's nothing related to this change as the same also occurs with explicitly typing `get_f() -> Variant` which the analyzer already allows).\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThe following code would give wrong return type hints in the editor:\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nvar _prop: int\r\n\r\nfunc get_f():\r\n    return _prop\r\n\r\nfunc test():\r\n    get_f()\r\n```\r\n\r\n<img width=\"265\" height=\"235\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a4c13435-611c-4fec-9b3f-c5a4e42739ce\" />\r\n\r\nIt now correctly shows the actual type of the function:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"265\" height=\"235\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cbe2c635-ee8e-4b62-b64e-5e17c7394ed1\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nEspecially the first issue might seem like a non-issue when viewed in isolation. However when looking at the analyzer as a whole it is one of the few cases, where soft-types do have an actual effect on something compilation critical. So we need to get rid of that behaviour if we want to remove soft-types.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121322/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121322/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}